.TH SLOWSCROLL-SETTINGS 1 "October 2026" "slowscroll 1.0.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
slowscroll\-settings \- settings window for slowscroll
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B slowscroll\-settings
.SH DESCRIPTION
A GTK4/libadwaita window to turn the \fBslowscroll\fR(1) service on or off and to
change two\-finger speed, acceleration, momentum and three\-finger speed, with a
reset button for each. It edits \fI~/.config/slowscroll.conf\fR.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR slowscroll (1)
